  "primaryText": "The NeoECO-classic 550 V2 psu is the best 80 PLUS Bronze Non Modular PSU with 550W/120mm fan/Japanese Caps/5-Year Warranty - Antec\nSTORE\nPRODUCT\nSYSTEM\nHandHeld\nCASE\n900\nFlux\nConstellation\nPerformance\nP SERIES\nCX Series\nAX Series\nNX SERIES\nVX SERIES\nVCX SERIES\nSmart Series\nVS SERIES\nPOWER SUPPLY\nBY SERIES\n80 PLUS\nCOOLING\nCASE FAN\nCPU LIQUID COOLER\nCPU AIR COOLER\nLaptop Cooler\nGaming Handheld Cooling\nACCESSORY\nCORE HS\nGPU Bracket\nGPU_PCIE 5.0 Riser Cable\nGPU_PCIE 4.0 Riser Cable\ncontroller\nPower Supply Related\nPSU Extension Cable\nHeadphones\nStands\nDISCONTINUED PRODUCTS\nCASE\nPSU\nCOOLING\nDDR4\nSOCIAL MEDIA\nDOWNLOADS\nSYSTEM\nCASE\nPOWER SUPPLY\nCOOLING\nACCESSORY\nSoftware\nABOUT US\nSQUAD\nATOM\nB&G\nSTORE\nPRODUCT\nSYSTEM\nHandHeld\nCASE\n900\nFlux\nConstellation\nPerformance\nP SERIES\nCX Series\nAX Series\nNX SERIES\nVX SERIES\nVCX SERIES\nSmart Series\nVS SERIES\nPOWER SUPPLY\nBY SERIES\n80 PLUS\nCOOLING\nCASE FAN\nCPU LIQUID COOLER\nCPU AIR COOLER\nLaptop Cooler\nGaming Handheld Cooling\nACCESSORY\nCORE HS\nGPU Bracket\nGPU_PCIE 5.0 Riser Cable\nGPU_PCIE 4.0 Riser Cable\nController\nPower Supply Related\nPSU Extension Cable\nHeadphones\nStands\nDISCONTINUED PRODUCTS\nCASE\nPSU\nCOOLING\nDDR4\nSOCIAL MEDIA\nDOWNLOADS\nSYSTEM\nCASE\nPOWER SUPPLY\nCOOLING\nACCESSORY\nSoftware\nABOUT US\nSQUAD\nATOM\nB&G\nSUPPORT\nWHERE TO BUY\nNEWS\nOVERVIEW\nSPECS\nGALLERY\nDOWNLOAD\nFLYER\nPROVIEW\nNeoECOCLASSIC\n550 v2\nHigh-Efficiency Power Supply\nGet economical power today with the NeoECO Modular, Antec's high-efficiency power supply solution. Featuring 80 PLUS® BRONZE certification, a quiet 120 mm fan, Japanese capacitors and Universal Input with Active Power Factor Correction, NeoECO Modular gives you a cooler, quieter system, all powered by Continuous Power.\n80 PLUS BronzeCertified\nUp to 88% efficient, to reduce your electricity bill.\nJapanese Heavy-duty Caps\nJapanese High-performance capacitors ensure tightest DC stability and regulation.\nContinuous Power\nNeoECO Classic gives you a cooler, quieter system, all powered by Continuous Power.\n120mm double ball Quiet Fan\nWhisper-quiet high-quality double ball bearing fan with long lifetime.\nstealth flat cable\nFor easier & better cable management.\nConnector\nEfficiency LoadAC INPUT: 100 - 240VAC\nNeoECOMODULAR\n550 v2\nHigh-Efficiency Power Supply\nNeoECOMODULAR\n550 v2\nHigh-Efficiency Power Supply\nSPECIFICATIONS\nModel\nNE550C V2\nType\nATX 12V 2.4\nModular\n－\nDimension\n140(L) x 150(W) x 86(H)\nWarranty\n5 years\nInput Voltage\n100-240 VAC\nInput Current\n8A-4A\nInput Frequency Range\n47Hz-63Hz\nPFC\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-500ms\nEfficiency\nUp to 88%\nProtection\nOCP / OVP / UVP / SCP / OPP / NLO\nOutput Capacity\n550W\nOperation Temperature\n0-40°C\nRegulatory\ncTUVus / TUV / CB[IEC62368 Compliant] / RCM / CE / CCC / BSMI / FCC\nFan\n120 mm Two Ball Fan\nCertifications\n80 Plus Bronze\nConnector\n1 x MB 24(20+4) Pin\n1 x 8(4+4) Pin EPS 12V\n2 x 8(6+2) Pin PCI-E\n8 x SATA\n3 x Molex\n1 x FDD\nNet Weight\n2.10 Kgs\nGross Weight\n2.25 Kgs\nUPC#\n[NE550C V2 AU][0-761345-11191-1]\n[NE550C V2 EC][0-761345-05552-9]\n[NE550C V2 GB][0-761345-05553-6]\n[NE550C V2 JP][0-761345-11340-3]\n[NE550C V2 KR][0-761345-10065-6]\nGALLERY\nCOMPANY\nABOUT US\nAWARDS\nCONTACT\nINVESTOR\nNEWS\nSOCIAL MEDIA\nSERVICE\nSUPPORT\nWHERE TO BUY\nFAQs\nTERMS OF USE\nSTAY CONNECTED\nCopyright © 2026 Antec. All rights reserved.",
